msgid "# Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B"
msgstr "# Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B is a large-scale MoE model with 2400 billion total\n"
"parameters and 95 billion activated parameters. It is built on the Qwen3.5\n"
"architecture and improves coding, professional work, scientific research, and\n"
"long-horizon agent tasks."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B 是一个大规模 MoE 模型，总参数量为 24000 亿，激活参数量为 950 亿。它基于 Qwen3.5 "
"架构构建，在编程、专业工作、科学研究和长周期智能体任务方面均有提升。"

msgid ""
"This document describes the main validation steps for the model, including\n"
"supported features, prerequisites, installation, multi-node deployment,\n"
"functional verification, accuracy and performance evaluation, performance\n"
"tuning, and FAQs. All configurations in this document are for Atlas A3."
msgstr ""
"本文档描述了该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持特性、前提条件、安装、多节点部署、功能验证、精度与性能评估、性能调优以及常见问题。本文档中的所有配置均针对 "
"Atlas A3。"

msgid ""
"This document is validated and written based on **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0**. The\n"
"current model (Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B) is first supported in this version."
msgstr ""
"本文档基于 **vLLM-Ascend 0.23.0** 进行验证和编写。当前模型（Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B）在该版本中首次获得支持。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持特性"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_features.md)\n"
"to get the model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_features.md)获取该模型的支持特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
":::{note}\n"
"The support matrix records the maximum verified capability for this model.\n"
"Adjust `--max-model-len`, `--max-num-seqs`, and\n"
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` based on your service workload and available KV\n"
"cache.\n"
":::"
msgstr ""
":::{note}\n"
"支持矩阵记录了该模型的最大已验证能力。请根据您的服务负载和可用 KV 缓存调整 `--max-model-len`、`--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。\n"
":::"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重"

msgid "The following model weights are available:"
msgstr "以下模型权重可用："

msgid ""
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B` (FP16/BF16): approximately 4.89 TB of storage and weight\n"
"  memory. [Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B).\n"
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w8a8`: approximately 2.33 TiB of storage and weight\n"
"  memory. [Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w8a8).\n"
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8`:\n"
"  [Download model weight](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8)."
msgstr ""
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B`（FP16/BF16）：约 4.89 TB 存储和权重内存。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B)。\n"
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w8a8`：约 2.33 TiB 存储和权重内存。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w8a8)。\n"
"- `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8`：[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B-w4a8)。"

msgid ""
"This guide includes the following validated A3 deployment configuration:"
msgstr "本指南包含以下已验证的 A3 部署配置："

msgid "| Platform | Deployment | Topology |"
msgstr "| 平台 | 部署方式 | 拓扑 |"

msgid ""
"The checkpoint and tokenizer directories must be available at the same paths\n"
"on all serving nodes. The W8A8 deployment uses the lazy Safetensors strategy to\n"
"avoid prefetching the complete checkpoint from shared storage."
msgstr ""
"检查点和分词器目录必须在所有服务节点上以相同路径可用。W8A8 部署使用惰性 Safetensors 策略，以避免从共享存储预取完整检查点。"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to download the model weight to the shared directory of\n"
"multiple nodes, such as `/root/.cache/`."
msgstr "建议将模型权重下载到多节点的共享目录中，例如 `/root/.cache/`。"

msgid "### 3.2 Verify Multi-node Communication (Optional)"
msgstr "### 3.2 验证多节点通信（可选）"

msgid ""
"If you want to deploy the model in a multi-node environment, verify the\n"
"communication environment according to\n"
"[verify multi-node communication environment](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-communication)."
msgstr ""
"如果要在多节点环境中部署模型，请按照[验证多节点通信环境](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-"
"communication)验证通信环境。"

msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "### 4.1 Docker Image Installation"
msgstr "### 4.1 Docker 镜像安装"

msgid ""
"Select the A3 image and start the docker image on each node. Refer to\n"
"[using docker](../../installation.md#set-up-using-docker)."
msgstr ""
"选择 A3 镜像并在每个节点上启动 docker 镜像。请参阅[使用 docker](../../installation.md#set-up-"
"using-docker)。"

msgid ""
"After entering the container, verify that vLLM and vLLM-Ascend can be "
"imported:"
msgstr "进入容器后，验证 vLLM 和 vLLM-Ascend 是否可以导入："

msgid "### 4.2 Source Code Installation"
msgstr "### 4.2 源码安装"

msgid ""
"You can also build and install `vllm-ascend` from source. Refer to\n"
"[set up using Python](../../installation.md#set-up-using-python)."
msgstr ""
"您也可以从源码构建并安装 `vllm-ascend`。请参阅[使用 Python 设置](../../installation.md#set-up-"
"using-python)。"

msgid ""
"If you want to deploy a multi-node service, install the same version of vLLM\n"
"and vLLM-Ascend on each node."
msgstr "如果要部署多节点服务，请在每个节点上安装相同版本的 vLLM 和 vLLM-Ascend。"

msgid "### 5.1 Atlas 800 A3 Multi-Node Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 Atlas 800 A3 多节点部署"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, node count, parallel sizes, local IP address, network\n"
"  interface, service port, and RPC port with values from the target\n"
"  environment.\n"
"- `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"- Start Node 0 first. `NODE0_IP` on every worker must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node\n"
"  0.\n"
"- Assign every worker a unique `DP_START_RANK`."
msgstr ""
"- 将模型路径、节点数、并行大小、本地 IP 地址、网络接口、服务端口和 RPC 端口替换为目标环境中的值。\n"
"- `NIC_NAME` 必须是拥有 `LOCAL_IP` 的接口。\n"
"- 先启动 Node 0。每个 worker 上的 `NODE0_IP` 必须等于 Node 0 上的 `LOCAL_IP`。\n"
"- 为每个 worker 分配唯一的 `DP_START_RANK`。"

msgid ""
":::::{tab-set}\n"
":sync-group: mixed-deployment"
msgstr ""
":::::{tab-set}\n"
":sync-group: mixed-deployment"

msgid ""
"::::{tab-item} Node 0\n"
":sync: node-0"
msgstr ""
"::::{tab-item} Node 0\n"
":sync: node-0"

msgid ""
"::::\n"
"::::{tab-item} Nodes 1-3\n"
":sync: worker-nodes"
msgstr ""
"::::\n"
"::::{tab-item} Nodes 1-3\n"
":sync: worker-nodes"

msgid ""
"Run this command on every worker. Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` to the current\n"
"node and set `DP_START_RANK` to `1`, `2`, or `3`."
msgstr ""
"在每个 worker 上运行此命令。将 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME` 设置为当前节点，并将 `DP_START_RANK` 设置为 "
"`1`、`2` 或 `3`。"

msgid "The following values differ between the master and worker nodes:"
msgstr "主节点和 worker 节点之间的以下值有所不同："

msgid "| Setting | Node 0 | Nodes 1-3 | Description |"
msgstr "| 设置项 | Node 0 | Nodes 1-3 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `LOCAL_IP` | Node 0 IP | Current worker IP | Each node uses its own "
"communication IP. |"
msgstr "| `LOCAL_IP` | Node 0 IP | 当前 worker IP | 每个节点使用自己的通信 IP。 |"

msgid ""
"| `NODE0_IP` | Not required | Node 0 IP | Workers use this address to join "
"the DP group. |"
msgstr "| `NODE0_IP` | 不需要 | Node 0 IP | Workers 使用此地址加入 DP 组。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--headless` | Omitted | Enabled | Workers do not expose an API endpoint. "
"|"
msgstr "| `--headless` | 省略 | 启用 | Workers 不暴露 API 端点。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-address` | `$LOCAL_IP` | `$NODE0_IP` | Always resolves to"
" Node 0. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-address` | `$LOCAL_IP` | `$NODE0_IP` | 始终解析为 Node 0。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | `0` by default | `1`, `2`, or `3` | Every "
"node must own a unique DP rank. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | 默认为 `0` | `1`、`2` 或 `3` | 每个节点必须拥有唯一的 DP "
"rank。 |"

msgid "Key deployment parameters:"
msgstr "关键部署参数："

msgid "| Parameter | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size 16` | Uses all 16 NPUs in one A3 node for tensor "
"parallelism. |"
msgstr "| `--tensor-parallel-size 16` | 使用一个 A3 节点中的全部 16 个 NPU 进行张量并行。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size 4` | Creates four global DP ranks across four nodes."
" |"
msgstr "| `--data-parallel-size 4` | 在四个节点上创建四个全局 DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | Runs one DP rank on the current node. |"
msgstr "| `--data-parallel-size-local 1` | 在当前节点上运行一个 DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | Selects the global DP rank of a worker "
"node. |"
msgstr "| `--data-parallel-start-rank` | 选择 worker 节点的全局 DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-expert-parallel` | Enables expert parallelism for the MoE "
"layers. |"
msgstr "| `--enable-expert-parallel` | 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len 131072` | Sets the maximum combined input and output "
"length. |"
msgstr "| `--max-model-len 131072` | 设置输入和输出的最大总长度。 |"

msgid "| `--quantization ascend` | Enables Ascend W8A8 quantization. |"
msgstr "| `--quantization ascend` | 启用Ascend W8A8量化。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | Avoids prefetching the complete 2.33 "
"TiB checkpoint from NFS. |"
msgstr "| `--safetensors-load-strategy lazy` | 避免从NFS预取完整的2.33 TiB检查点。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs 8` | Sets eight active sequences for each DP group and 32 "
"across DP4. |"
msgstr "| `--max-num-seqs 8` | 为每个DP组设置8个活动序列，在DP4下共32个。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | Controls the scheduler token budget. |"
msgstr "| `--max-num-batched-tokens 16384` | 控制调度器的token预算。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.85` | Reserves HBM headroom for runtime "
"memory. |"
msgstr "| `--gpu-memory-utilization 0.85` | 为运行时内存预留HBM空间。 |"

msgid "| `--enable-prefix-caching` | Enables automatic prefix caching. |"
msgstr "| `--enable-prefix-caching` | 启用自动前缀缓存。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--speculative-config` | Enables one Qwen3.5 MTP speculative token. |"
msgstr "| `--speculative-config` | 启用一个Qwen3.5 MTP推测token。 |"

msgid "| `--compilation-config` | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL Graph replay. |"
msgstr "| `--compilation-config` | 使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACL图重放。 |"

msgid ""
"If a worker exits immediately, confirm that Node 0 is already running,\n"
"`--data-parallel-address` resolves to Node 0, all nodes use the same RPC port,\n"
"and every worker uses a unique DP start rank."
msgstr ""
"如果某个worker立即退出，请确认Node 0已在运行，\n"
"`--data-parallel-address`解析到Node 0，所有节点使用相同的RPC端口，\n"
"并且每个worker使用唯一的DP起始rank。"

msgid "### 5.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation (A3)"
msgstr "### 5.2 Prefill-Decode分离部署（A3）"

msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service groups.\n"
"Prefill nodes process prompt chunks, Decode nodes serve token generation, and\n"
"a proxy forwards requests between them."
msgstr ""
"PD分离部署将Prefill和Decode划分为不同的服务组。\n"
"Prefill节点处理提示词块，Decode节点负责token生成，\n"
"代理在两者之间转发请求。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for\n"
"the general PD disaggregation workflow. Use the following values in the engine\n"
"templates and `launch_online_dp.py`:"
msgstr ""
"有关通用PD分离部署工作流，请参阅[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。\n"
"在引擎模板和`launch_online_dp.py`中使用以下值："

msgid "| Setting | Value | Description |"
msgstr "| 设置项 | 值 | 描述 |"

msgid "| Topology | 8P8D | Eight Prefill and eight Decode nodes. |"
msgstr "| 拓扑 | 8P8D | 8个Prefill节点和8个Decode节点。 |"

msgid "| `--dp-size` | `8` | Eight DP ranks on each side. |"
msgstr "| `--dp-size` | `8` | 每侧8个DP rank。 |"

msgid "| `--tp-size` | `16` | Uses all 16 NPUs in one A3 node. |"
msgstr "| `--tp-size` | `16` | 使用一个A3节点中的所有16个NPU。 |"

msgid "| `--pp-size` | `1` | Uses one pipeline stage in each engine. |"
msgstr "| `--pp-size` | `1` | 每个引擎使用一个流水线阶段。 |"

msgid "| `--dp-size-local` | `1` | Runs one DP rank on each node. |"
msgstr "| `--dp-size-local` | `1` | 每个节点运行一个DP rank。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len` | `133120` | Sets the combined input and output limit. |"
msgstr "| `--max-model-len` | `133120` | 设置输入和输出的总长度限制。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192` | Controls the scheduler token budget."
" |"
msgstr "| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192` | 控制调度器的token预算。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-seqs` | `16` | Sets the maximum active sequences for each DP "
"group. |"
msgstr "| `--max-num-seqs` | `16` | 设置每个DP组的最大活动序列数。 |"

msgid ""
"Use ranks `0` through `7` for each eight-node side. The `prefill` and `decode`\n"
"parallel settings in `--kv-transfer-config` must match the actual engine\n"
"settings."
msgstr ""
"每个八节点侧使用rank `0`到`7`。`--kv-transfer-config`中的`prefill`和`decode`\n"
"并行设置必须与实际引擎设置匹配。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid "### 6.1 Atlas 800 A3"
msgstr "### 6.1 Atlas 800 A3"

msgid ""
"After all DP ranks are ready, send a text request to the Node 0 API endpoint.\n"
"The open-weight model always uses thinking mode and does not support\n"
"multimodal input."
msgstr ""
"在所有DP rank就绪后，向Node 0 API端点发送文本请求。\n"
"开放权重模型始终使用思考模式，不支持\n"
"多模态输入。"

msgid ""
"Each response begins with reasoning wrapped in `<think>...</think>`, followed\n"
"by the final answer. The service should return HTTP 200 and a `choices` field\n"
"containing generated text. Worker nodes are headless and do not accept HTTP\n"
"requests directly."
msgstr ""
"每个响应以`<think>...</think>`包裹的推理内容开头，随后\n"
"是最终答案。服务应返回HTTP 200和包含生成文本的`choices`字段。\n"
"Worker节点为无头模式，不直接接受HTTP请求。"

msgid "The model officially supports these reasoning effort levels:"
msgstr "该模型官方支持以下推理力度级别："

msgid ""
"- `xhigh`: default; deeper reasoning for complex tasks.\n"
"- `medium`: balances accuracy and speed.\n"
"- `low`: prioritizes speed and cost."
msgstr ""
"- `xhigh`：默认；针对复杂任务进行更深层次的推理。\n"
"- `medium`：在准确性和速度之间取得平衡。\n"
"- `low`：优先考虑速度和成本。"

msgid "## 7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "## 7 精度评估"

msgid "### 7.1 Prepare the Evaluation Environment"
msgstr "### 7.1 准备评估环境"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Using AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)\n"
"and [Using lm_eval](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_lm_eval.md) for the\n"
"evaluation environment and dataset preparation."
msgstr ""
"有关评估环境和数据集准备，请参阅[使用AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)\n"
"和[使用lm_eval](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_lm_eval.md)。"

msgid "### 7.2 Check the Service"
msgstr "### 7.2 检查服务"

msgid ""
"Before running the benchmark, verify that the service exposes the expected\n"
"model name:"
msgstr ""
"在运行基准测试之前，请验证服务是否暴露了预期的\n"
"模型名称："

msgid "The response must contain `qwen3.8` before running the evaluation."
msgstr "在运行评估之前，响应必须包含`qwen3.8`。"

msgid "### 7.3 Run the Evaluation"
msgstr "### 7.3 运行评估"

msgid ""
"Set the evaluation tool's model name to `qwen3.8` and its base URL to the Node\n"
"0 API endpoint. Keep thinking mode enabled and preserve the reasoning output."
msgstr ""
"将评估工具的模型名称设置为`qwen3.8`，其基础URL设置为Node\n"
"0 API端点。保持思考模式启用并保留推理输出。"

msgid ""
"The official model card recommends the following sampling configuration:"
msgstr "官方模型卡推荐以下采样配置："

msgid ""
"The supported `reasoning_effort` values are `xhigh`, `medium`, and `low`.\n"
"Keep the model revision, reasoning effort, context length, prompt template,\n"
"sampling parameters, and evaluation framework fixed when comparing accuracy."
msgstr ""
"支持的`reasoning_effort`值为`xhigh`、`medium`和`low`。\n"
"在比较精度时，请保持模型版本、推理力度、上下文长度、提示词模板、\n"
"采样参数和评估框架不变。"

msgid "## 8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "## 8 性能评估"

msgid "### 8.1 Install AISBench"
msgstr "### 8.1 安装AISBench"

msgid ""
"Run AISBench in a separate environment or container so that the load generator\n"
"does not affect the serving processes. Refer to\n"
"[Using AISBench for performance evaluation](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)."
msgstr ""
"在独立的环境或容器中运行AISBench，以便负载生成器\n"
"不影响服务进程。请参阅\n"
"[使用AISBench进行性能评估](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md#execute-performance-evaluation)。"

msgid "### 8.2 Performance Service Configuration"
msgstr "### 8.2 性能服务配置"

msgid ""
"Use the deployment in Section 5 as the baseline. Change the following values\n"
"on all four nodes:"
msgstr "以第5节中的部署为基线。在所有四个节点上更改以下值："

msgid "| Parameter | Standard deployment | Performance test |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 标准部署 | 性能测试 |"

msgid "### 8.3 Run the Tests"
msgstr "### 8.3 运行测试"

msgid ""
"Run performance evaluation of `Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B` as an example. Refer to\n"
"[vLLM benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for more details."
msgstr ""
"以`Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B`为例运行性能评估。有关更多详细信息，请参阅\n"
"[vLLM基准测试](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"Record the A3 node count, TP/PP/EP topology, context length, concurrency,\n"
"reasoning effort, and weight revision together with the result."
msgstr ""
"记录A3节点数量、TP/PP/EP拓扑、上下文长度、并发数、\n"
"推理力度和权重版本，并与结果一起保存。"

msgid "### 8.4 Enabled Optimizations"
msgstr "### 8.4 已启用的优化"

msgid "| Feature | Description |"
msgstr "| 特性 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| Chunked Prefill | Splits long prefill inputs into chunks to reduce per-"
"step memory peaks. |"
msgstr "| 分块Prefill | 将较长的prefill输入拆分为多个块，以减少每一步的内存峰值。 |"

msgid "| Prefix Cache | Reuses KV state for repeated prefixes. |"
msgstr "| 前缀缓存 | 对重复前缀复用KV状态。 |"

msgid "| DP + TP + EP | Uses DP4/TP16/EP64 across four A3 nodes. |"
msgstr "| DP + TP + EP | 在四个A3节点上使用DP4/TP16/EP64。 |"

msgid "| W8A8 | Uses Ascend quantization for the validated checkpoint. |"
msgstr "| W8A8 | 对已验证的检查点使用Ascend量化。 |"

msgid "| Lazy Safetensors | Avoids prefetching the complete NFS checkpoint. |"
msgstr "| Lazy Safetensors | 避免预取完整的NFS检查点。 |"

msgid "| MTP | Uses one speculative token with the `qwen3_5_mtp` method. |"
msgstr "| MTP | 使用`qwen3_5_mtp`方法配合一个推测性token。 |"

msgid "| ACL Graph | Uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` replay. |"
msgstr "| ACL Graph | 使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`重放。 |"

msgid ""
"| Fused MC2 | Enabled through the environment and additional configuration. "
"|"
msgstr "| Fused MC2 | 通过环境变量和额外配置启用。 |"

msgid "| CPU Binding | Reduces cross-core scheduling overhead. |"
msgstr "| CPU绑定 | 减少跨核调度开销。 |"

msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid ""
"Use the deployment values above as a baseline. Adjust `max-model-len`,\n"
"`max-num-seqs`, `max-num-batched-tokens`, and `gpu-memory-utilization` together\n"
"for the target workload."
msgstr ""
"以上述部署参数为基线。根据目标工作负载，同时调整`max-model-len`、\n"
"`max-num-seqs`、`max-num-batched-tokens`和`gpu-memory-utilization`。"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid "- **Q: Which inputs are supported by the open-weight model?**"
msgstr "- **问：开放权重模型支持哪些输入？**"

msgid ""
"A: Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B is a text-only model. It does not support multimodal\n"
"  input."
msgstr ""
"答：Qwen3.8-2.4T-A95B是纯文本模型。它不支持多模态\n"
"  输入。"

msgid "- **Q: Can thinking mode be disabled?**"
msgstr "- **问：可以禁用思考模式吗？**"

msgid ""
"A: No. Keep `enable_thinking=true`. The response starts with reasoning in a\n"
"  `<think>` block and then returns the final answer."
msgstr ""
"答：不可以。请保持`enable_thinking=true`。响应会先在\n"
"  `<think>`块中输出推理过程，然后返回最终答案。"

msgid "- **Q: How should the parallel sizes be selected?**"
msgstr "- **问：如何选择并行度参数？**"

msgid ""
"A: Select TP, PP, DP, and EP together according to model compatibility,\n"
"  weight memory, KV-cache capacity, and communication performance. Validate\n"
"  the complete topology on the target A3 cluster."
msgstr ""
"答：根据模型兼容性、\n"
"  权重内存、KV缓存容量和通信性能，综合选择TP、PP、DP和EP。\n"
"  请在目标A3集群上验证完整的拓扑配置。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [Feature Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get feature\n"
"configuration details."
msgstr "请参阅[功能指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)以获取功能配置详情。"

msgid ""
"| 4 × Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) | Mixed Prefill/Decode deployment | "
"DP4/TP16/EP64 |"
msgstr "| 4 × Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) | 混合预填充/解码部署 | DP4/TP16/EP64 |"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment {: #5-online-service-deployment }"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署 {: #5-online-service-deployment }"

msgid ""
"The validated mixed deployment uses four Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) nodes. Data\n"
"parallelism spans the four nodes, each node runs one DP rank, and tensor\n"
"parallelism uses all 16 NPUs in the node. The resulting topology is\n"
"DP4/TP16/EP64."
msgstr ""
"已验证的混合部署使用四个 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) 节点。数据并行跨越四个节点，每个节点运行一个 DP "
"秩，张量并行使用节点内的全部 16 个 NPU。最终拓扑为 DP4/TP16/EP64。"

msgid "| `--additional-config` | Enables CPU binding and Fused MC2. |"
msgstr "| `--additional-config` | 启用 CPU 绑定和 Fused MC2。 |"

msgid ""
"The current validated configuration covers mixed Prefill/Decode deployment.\n"
"The following PD topology is based on the Kimi-K3 reference and has not been\n"
"validated with Qwen3.8: 16 Atlas 800 A3 (64GB × 16) nodes, with eight Prefill\n"
"nodes and eight Decode nodes. Both sides use DP8/TP16/PP1."
msgstr ""
"当前已验证的配置涵盖混合预填充/解码部署。以下 PD 拓扑基于 Kimi-K3 参考，尚未使用 Qwen3.8 验证：16 个 Atlas 800 A3"
" (64GB × 16) 节点，其中八个预填充节点和八个解码节点。两侧均使用 DP8/TP16/PP1。"

